#!/usr/local/bin/dyalogscript ENABLE_CEF=0
⍝ APL Othello on the desktop: ui/App.apln drawn with raylibAPL. Run from the project root: ./ui/othello.apls
⍝ Click to move. N new game, U undo, S swap sides, H hints, + / - engine time, Esc quit.
⎕IO←0
root←⊃1⎕NPARTS''
z←{2⎕FIX'file://',root,⍵}¨'src/Othello.apln' 'src/Games.apln' 'ui/App.apln'
rlDir←root,'vendor/raylibAPL/link/'
rl←0⎕Fix rlDir,'raylib.apln'
rl.Init rlDir
#.App.Run rl
